:: CornerStore [nobr]
<<HUD>>
<<set $luckyMartVisits += 1>>

<<if not $metHector>>
<div class="prose-block">
<p>The corner store on the ground floor of a building that&apos;s seen better decades. Fluorescent lights, a bell over the door that&apos;s lost half its ring, lottery ticket ads curling in the window.</p>
<p>Behind the register, a man in his forties, neat mustache, warm brown eyes, a plain polo with a name tag that reads <strong>LUIS</strong>. A newspaper is open in front of him. He looks up.</p>
</div>
<<Dialogue "Hector" "🧔" "Hey there, what can I get you?" "">>
<<set $metHector to true>>
<<else>>
<div class="prose-block">
<p>Same bell, same fluorescent hum. Hector looks up from his newspaper.</p>
</div>
<<set _rbGreet to window.rbRandom(1, $luckyMartVisits >= 5 ? 4 : 3)>>
<<switch _rbGreet>>
<<case 1>><<Dialogue "Hector" "🧔" "Morning, sweetheart." "">>
<<case 2>><<Dialogue "Hector" "🧔" "Hey there, what can I get you?" "">>
<<case 3>><<if $player.att gte 30>><<Dialogue "Hector" "🧔" "You look nice today." "">><<else>><<Dialogue "Hector" "🧔" "Cold enough for you?" "">><</if>>
<<case 4>><<Dialogue "Hector" "🧔" "The usual?" "">>
<</switch>>
<</if>>

<div class="action-list">

<<if $player.money gte 2>>
	<<link '<span class="action-icon">🍫</span><span class="action-text">Buy a candy bar<span class="action-sub">A little sugar, a little stupid</span></span><span class="action-cost">$2</span>' "CornerStore">>
		<<run window.rbSpend(2, "snack")>>
		<<set $player.energy to Math.clamp($player.energy + 6, 0, 100)>>
		<<set $player.stress to Math.clamp($player.stress - 2, 0, 100)>>
	<</link>>
<<else>>
	<div class="action-btn action-locked"><span class="action-icon">🍫</span><span class="action-text">Buy a candy bar<span class="action-sub">You&apos;re $2 short</span></span></div>
<</if>>

<<link '<span class="action-icon">💬</span><span class="action-text">Make small talk with Hector<span class="action-sub">He&apos;s always got something to say</span></span>' "CornerStore_SmallTalk">><</link>>

<<link '<span class="action-icon">👀</span><span class="action-text">Just look around<span class="action-sub">Window shopping, apparently, applies to gas station snacks too</span></span>' "CornerStore">><</link>>

<<if $day gte 3 and not $metMangoCraving>>
	<<link '<span class="action-icon">🥭</span><span class="action-text">Get groceries (and those mangoes)<span class="action-sub">Pasta, sauce, eggs, bananas, and two bruised mangoes calling your name</span></span><span class="action-cost">$18.40</span>' "CornerStore_Mango">><</link>>
<</if>>

<<if $day gte 3 and not $itemsOwned.hairCare>>
	<<link '<span class="action-icon">🧴</span><span class="action-text">Buy hair &amp; body care<span class="action-sub">Shampoo, conditioner, lotion</span></span><span class="action-cost">$14.20</span>' "CornerStore">>
		<<if window.rbSpend(14.20, "toiletries")>>
			<<set $itemsOwned.hairCare to true>>
		<</if>>
	<</link>>
<</if>>

<<if $day gte 3 and not $itemsOwned.pantyLiners>>
	<<link '<span class="action-icon">🩹</span><span class="action-text">Buy panty liners<span class="action-sub">Just in case</span></span><span class="action-cost">$4</span>' "CornerStore">>
		<<if window.rbSpend(4, "toiletries")>>
			<<set $itemsOwned.pantyLiners to true>>
		<</if>>
	<</link>>
<</if>>

</div>

<<if $day is 2 and not $metAnanyaStore and window.rbRandom(1, 10) lte 4>>

<<SceneDivider "The Aisle Collision">>

<div class="prose-block">
<p>I round the corner of aisle 3 and nearly collide with another customer. She&apos;s about my age, maybe a year older, with dark curly hair, a State University hoodie, and a basket full of what looks like exclusively Hot Pockets and wine.</p>
<p>&quot;Oh! Sorry!&quot; She steadies her basket. One of the Hot Pockets makes a break for freedom and I catch it before it hits the floor.</p>
</div>

<<Dialogue "Ananya" "🎓" "Nice reflexes. I'm Ananya. Not the lingerie Ananya, I don't know any lingerie Ananya, that would be weird. Just... Ananya." "">>
<<Dialogue "You" "🙂" "Mia." "you">>
<<Dialogue "Ananya" "🎓" "Cool name. You go to State? I feel like I've seen you around." "">>

<div class="prose-block">
<p>She hasn&apos;t, obviously, she&apos;s never seen me because I didn&apos;t exist before Thursday. But her face is open and friendly, and she&apos;s the first person my age who&apos;s spoken to me since the transformation who isn&apos;t a medical professional or a delivery customer.</p>
</div>

<<Dialogue "You" "🙂" "Yeah. Second year." "you">>
<<Dialogue "Ananya" "🎓" "Me too! We should study together sometime. I'm pre-law and I'm dying. Like, actively dying. Torts are killing me." "">>

<div class="prose-block">
<p>She scribbles her number on the back of a Hot Pocket box, tears off the flap, and hands it to me. &quot;Text me! Or don&apos;t. No pressure. But seriously, torts. I need help.&quot;</p>
<p>She waves and disappears around the pasta sauce aisle. I stand there holding a piece of cardboard with a phone number on it, written in purple ink, smelling faintly of pepperoni.</p>
<p>I think I just made a friend. Do women make friends this fast normally? Is this just how it works?</p>
</div>

<div class="choice-block">
	<<link '<span>🍬 Keep shopping</span>' "CornerStore">>
		<<set $metAnanyaStore to true>>
		<<run window.rbAddMilestone("Made a friend at the corner store. Maybe.")>>
	<</link>>
</div>

<<elseif $luckyMartVisits gte 2>>
<<set _rbEnc to window.rbRandom(1, 10)>>
<<if _rbEnc lte 4>>

<<SceneDivider "In the Aisles">>

<<switch _rbEnc>>

<<case 1 2>>
<div class="prose-block">
<p>A woman with a toddler on her hip is stretching for something on the top shelf, the kid wailing at a pitch that could strip paint off the walls.</p>
</div>
<div class="choice-block">
	<<link '<span>🙋 Reach it for her</span>' "CornerStore">>
		<<set $player.con to Math.clamp($player.con + 1, 0, 100)>>
		<<run window.rbAddJournalEntry("Small Kindness", "Helped a mom reach a shelf at Lucky Mart. She thanked me like I'd done something bigger than that.")>>
	<</link>>
	<<link '<span>🚶 Keep to your own aisle</span>' "CornerStore">><</link>>
</div>

<<case 3>>
<div class="prose-block">
<p>A teenage stockboy is restocking shelves nearby. He glances over, sees you, drops a can. It rolls under the shelf. He doesn&apos;t chase it.</p>
<p><em>He&apos;s basically a child, and I feel old, and I&apos;m twenty.</em></p>
</div>
<div class="choice-block">
	<<link '<span>🙂 Smile and move on</span>' "CornerStore">><</link>>
</div>

<<case 4>>
<div class="prose-block">
<p>A guy in a hoodie is lingering by the beer cooler, glancing over every few seconds like he&apos;s working up the nerve to say something. He never does. You check out and leave. He&apos;s still standing there.</p>
</div>

<</switch>>

<</if>>
<</if>>

<div class="choice-block" style="margin-top:2rem;">
	<<link '<span>← Back outside</span>' "Outside">><</link>>
</div>

:: CornerStore_Mango [nobr]
<<HUD>>

<<ImagePlaceholder "Interior of Lucky Mart, a cardboard box of mangoes by the register" "banner" "assets/locations/cornerstore/interior.png">>

<div class="prose-block">

<p>They're sitting in a small cardboard box next to the register, slightly bruised, reduced to $1.50 each. The craving from this morning hits me again, immediate and physical, saliva flooding my mouth.</p>

<p>I grab two and add them to my pile. Hector rings me up without really looking at my face, eyes on the soccer game. "$18.40," he says, and I hand him a twenty. Our fingers brush during the handoff.</p>

<p>I take the bag and walk back to the apartment and eat a mango standing over the kitchen sink, because the juice runs down my chin and my wrists and I don't own enough paper towels to do this at the table. The mango is sweet and bright and slightly acidic, and it's exactly what my body wanted, and the satisfaction is so pure and simple that I almost cry over it.</p>

<p>A mango. I'm almost crying over a mango. This is what my life is now.</p>

</div>

<<set $metMangoCraving to true>>
<<run window.rbSpend(18.40, "food")>>
<<set $hasGroceries to true>>
<<set $d03Ate to true>>
<<run window.statChange("stress", -5)>>

<div class="choice-block">
	<<link '<span>← Back to the counter</span>' "CornerStore">><</link>>
</div>

:: CornerStore_SmallTalk [nobr]
<<HUD>>

<div class="prose-block">

<<if not $knowsBeanSoupRecipe>>
<<Dialogue "Hector" "🧔" "You eating enough? You always buy ramen. Let me tell you something, my wife makes a bean soup that costs less than ramen and tastes like God's kitchen. You want the recipe?" "">>
<<Dialogue "You" "🙂" "I... yeah. Actually, yes." "you">>
<p>He writes it on the back of a receipt, unprompted pride in his handwriting.</p>
<<else>>
<<Dialogue "Hector" "🧔" "They say rain tomorrow. You got an umbrella?" "">>
<<Dialogue "You" "🙂" "No." "you">>
<<Dialogue "Hector" "🧔" "Aisle 3, bottom shelf. Eight bucks. Worth it." "">>
<</if>>

</div>

<div class="choice-block">
	<<link '<span>← Back to the counter</span>' "CornerStore">>
		<<if not $knowsBeanSoupRecipe>>
			<<set $knowsBeanSoupRecipe to true>>
			<<run window.rbAddMilestone("Learned Hector's bean soup recipe.")>>
		<</if>>
		<<set $player.stress to Math.clamp($player.stress - 2, 0, 100)>>
	<</link>>
</div>
